mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985950/fb4fe16ff951246ae176e4335a77cb9b482b8ee1/ss_fb4fe16ff951246ae176e4335a77cb9b482b8ee1.600x338.jpg?t=1774011098"}],"short_description":"Welcome to the Reincarnation Insurance Program! This top-down roguelite shooter blends Diablo-style looting with Survivor-like mayhem. Face screen-filling zombie tides, use Divine Tech to liquidate them into ash, and farm god-tier gear to forge your OP build.","steam_appid":3985950,"support_info":{"email":"support@2pgames.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, German, Russian, Korean","type":"game","website":null}